atch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108148.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes:\r\n- Indirect draw command buffer memory leak\r\n- GPU out of memory if `use_indirect=true` and `multimesh_set_visible_instances(rid, -1)`\r\n- GPU out of memory if `multimesh_allocate_data(rid, 1)` and then `multimesh_allocate_data(rid, -1)`\r\n\r\nAnd:\r\n- Simplify setting vertex count in the command buffer (follow-up to the 2nd in [99455#comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99455#pullrequestreview-2548874964))\r\n- Follow the visible instance count rather than making all instances invisible, after setting a mesh with indirect drawing\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108148/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108148/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}